libredwg
------------------------------------------
GNU LibreDWG is a free C library to handle DWG files. It aims to be a free
replacement for the OpenDWG libraries. DWG is the native file format of
AutoCAD.

Runtime requirements:
  bash-5.2.21-1
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  cygwin-devel-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libiconv2-1.19-2
  libpcre2_16_0-10.49-1
  libpcre2_8_0-10.49-1
  libps0-0.4.8-1bl2
  libredwg-devel-0.14-1bl1
  libredwg0-0.14-1bl1
  perl_base-5.44.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1
  python3-3.12.12-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.11-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gettext-devel-0.22.5-1
  libpcre2-devel-10.49-1
  libps-devel-0.4.8-1bl2
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2
  perl-5.44.0-1
  python3-3.12.12-1
  python3-devel-3.12.12-1
  swig-4.5.1-1

Canonical website:
  https://www.gnu.org/software/libredwg/

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/LibreDWG/libredwg.git

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libredwg-0.14-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libredwg-0.14-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libredwg-0.14-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libredwg-0.14-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libredwg0-0.14-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libredwg-devel-0.14-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/perl-libredwg-0.14-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-libredwg-0.14-X.tar.xz

